  "description": "Jun-Won is a perfectly ordinary office worker who values routine and predictability above all else. Because of this, he finds himself constantly aggravated by Yi-Jae, a fellow colleague who joined the company at the exact same time. From their work ethics to their basic personalities, Yi-Jae is the complete polar opposite of Jun-Won, making his very presence a daily source of intense frustration.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
